ein interest kam tha, lekin ab woh har din naye words aur sounds explore karta hai. Book ki finishing premium hai, pages thick hain aur use karna bhi bahut easy hai. Highly recommended for preschool kids! 🌈📖❤️<\/p>","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"image_Hprm33":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/diliver_1.png","width":100,"Full_mobile_width":false,"alignment":"center","border_radius":0,"margin_top":15,"margin_bottom":15}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{"margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":24}},"collapsible_tab_fL66yp":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Product Specifications","heading_size":"medium","icon":"note","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top_border":true,"open":false,"content":"<ul><li><strong>Product Name:<\/strong> Phonics Sound Book For Kids<\/li><li><strong>Learning Content:<\/strong> Comprehensive Phonics Curriculum with Letters, Blends, Sight Words &amp; Early Vocabulary<\/li><li><strong>Audio Technology:<\/strong> Interactive One-Touch Sound Buttons with Clear Pronunciation for Every Word<\/li><li><strong>Book Material:<\/strong> Premium Thick Hardcover with Durable, Child-Friendly Laminated Pages<\/li><li><strong>Power Source:<\/strong> Built-In USB Rechargeable Battery – No Disposable Batteries Required<\/li><li><strong>Battery Backup:<\/strong> Provides Up to 3–5 Hours of Continuous Interactive Learning per Charge<\/li><li><strong>Charging System:<\/strong> Fast USB Charging with Included Charging Cable<\/li><li><strong>Learning Modes:<\/strong> Alphabet Recognition, Phonics Practice, Word Building &amp; Vocabulary Development<\/li><li><strong>Age Recommendation:<\/strong> Specially Designed for Children Ages 3 Years &amp; Above<\/li><\/ul>","page":"","margin_top":24,"margin_bottom":0}},"collapsible_tab_3cLf9t":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Package Includes","heading_size":"medium","icon":"box","filled_icon":false,"collapse_icon":"carret","display_top